[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0124","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0036","title":"MIT Kerberos 5 ASN.1 解码器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos V5 的 ASN.1 解码器存在整数符号错误漏洞，在 krb5 1.2.5 之前版本中，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的包含大无符号数据元素长度的 ASN.1 编码数据包，该长度值随后被作为负数使用，触发解码器处理异常，导致目标 Kerberos 服务崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MIT Kerberos 5-1.2.1 至 1.2.4 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。Red Hat 已发布安全公告 RHSA-2003-052 修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0036"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:38Z","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos V5 至 krb5 1.2.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ASN.1 解码器中的整数符号错误。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界限制对 Kerberos 服务（默认端口 88/udp）的访问，仅允许受信任的客户端连接以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000639","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/MITKRB5-SA-2003-001-multiple.txt","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/587579","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:043","http://www.osvdb.org/4896","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-051.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-052.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-168.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6713","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11190","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0036","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0036.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0036.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4hr3-85ww-cj5w/GHSA-4hr3-85ww-cj5w.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-052.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2002-0036.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2003-043.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e0e9ace3-f233-4e38-b2f4-4433553da04e.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0092","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1405","title":"Lynx 浏览器 CRLF 注入漏洞","description":"标签包裹。<value>Lynx 2.8.4 及更早版本存在 CRLF 注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含编码回车符、换行符及空白字符的恶意 URL，在通过命令行参数传递给 Lynx 的 HTTP 请求中注入虚假 HTTP 头部。该漏洞影响使用命令行方式调用 Lynx 并访问不可信 URL 的场景，攻击者无需身份认证即可在网络可达的前提下实施利用，可能导致 HTTP 请求被篡改或欺骗。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1405"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:16Z","remediation":"升级 Lynx 至 2.8.5 或更高版本（该版本修复了命令行 URL 的 CRLF 注入漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，可通过以下缓解措施：1) 避免在命令行直接传递不可信 URL，改用配置文件或交互模式；2) 在应用层过滤用户输入中的 %0D、%0A、%0d、%0a 等编码字符；3) 使用代理或 WAF 拦截包含 CRLF 序列的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102978118411977&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103003793418021&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-210","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9887.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:023","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-029.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-030.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5499","http://www.trustix.net/errata/misc/2002/TSL-2002-0085-lynx-ssl.asc.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21722","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1405","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/52862ce9daccf736821f20dad3f82fea401e5f1e/2002/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1405.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/6bb18b34820034d354785c1f34bbb7285e8899e0/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1405.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1405.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0072","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1348","title":"w3m 文本浏览器 IMG标签ALT属性HTML转义不当跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"w3m 文本浏览器 0.3.2.2 及之前版本在处理 IMG 标签的 ALT 属性时未正确转义 HTML 标签，导致跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的 IMG 标签 ALT 属性，诱导受害者使用 w3m 访问包含该恶意内容的页面，触发脚本执行从而窃取本地文件或 Cookie 信息。攻击需用户主动浏览恶意页面，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），影响范围为未升级至 0.3.2.2 版本的 w3m 用户。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1348"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 w3m 到 0.3.2.2 或更高版本（可通过包管理器如 apt upgrade w3m 或 yum update w3m 安装）。若暂时无法升级，可通过编辑配置文件 ~/.w3m/config 设置 display_image=0 禁用图片显示，或在防火墙层面限制不受信任网站的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104552193927323&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=126233","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-249","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-250","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-251","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11266.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-044.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6794","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1348","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce1c7bf4468f226d3b5ffdf52fb2db0cd4a31a97/2002/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1348.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/a36f4d76cddb1767f6fb47db88b804871b726290/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1348.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1348.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0072.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0383","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0383.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1402","title":"PostgreSQL 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 7.2.1 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于对 TZ 和 SET TIME ZONE 环境变量的边界检查不充分。本地攻击者可通过向受影响系统设置特制的时区环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，导致系统拒绝服务，并可能利用该漏洞执行任意代码，获取目标系统的控制权限。该漏洞影响 PostgreSQL 7.2.1 及之前版本，需本地用户权限触发，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1402"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:15Z","remediation":"立即升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.2.2 或更高版本以修复 TZ 和 SET TIME ZONE 环境变量的缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 7.2.x 系列已停止维护，建议升级至仍在支持的最新稳定版本（如 16.x/17.x）。如无法立即升级，可在操作系统层面限制不可信用户的本地登录权限，并在 pg_hba.conf 中将本地连接认证方式从 trust 改为 md5 或 scram-sha-256，同时通过 SELinux/AppArmor 限制 postgres 进程的额外权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.postgresql.org/pgsql-announce/2002-08/msg00004.php","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000524","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103021186622725&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103036987114437&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/8034","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-165","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:062","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-001.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1402","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2002/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1402.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1402.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-14xx/CVE-2002-1402.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0383.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0382","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0382.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1401","title":"PostgreSQL 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 7.2.3 及之前版本中存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，具体位于 circle_poly、path_encode 和 path_add 函数中，可能由整数溢出引发。攻击者可通过向受影响系统发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞需拥有有效数据库登录权限方可利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1401"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:15Z","remediation":"升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 circle_poly、path_encode 和 path_add 函数中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-165 安装安全更新，Red Hat 用户可应用 RHSA-2003-001 提供的补丁包。由于 7.2 系列已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全支持期内的 PostgreSQL 最新稳定版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.postgresql.org/pgsql-hackers/2002-08/msg02047.php","http://archives.postgresql.org/pgsql-hackers/2002-08/msg02081.php","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000524","http://secunia.com/advisories/8034","http://www.debian.org/securi