rl":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0380.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0379","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0379.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1398","title":"PostgreSQL 日期解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"PostgreSQL 7.2.2 之前版本的日期解析器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者通过向目标系统提交超长日期字符串（datetime 输入），可触发缓冲区溢出，导致数据库服务拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能执行任意代码。该漏洞需要本地或低权限访问，攻击复杂度较低，成功利用后可获取目标系统的部分机密性、完整性和可用性。建议升级至 PostgreSQL 7.2.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1398"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:15Z","remediation":"升级 PostgreSQL 至 7.2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 date parser 中处理超长日期字符串时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对日期输入做长度校验，限制日期字符串不超过 32 字节。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.postgresql.org/pgsql-announce/2002-08/msg00004.php","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102978152712430&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102996089613404&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103021186622725&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103036987114437&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=postgresql-announce&m=103062536330644","http://secunia.com/advisories/8034","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-165","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_038_postgresql.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1398.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1398.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1398.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1398","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1398.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1398.md","https