Servlet 请求处理不当，无需身份认证即可远程利用，属于 CAN-2002-1148 的变种。影响所有使用受影响版本的 Apache Tomcat 服务器，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1394"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 4.0.6 及以上版本（该漏洞已在 4.0.6 中修复）。如无法立即升级，删除 `$CATALINA_HOME/conf/web.xml` 中 invoker servlet 的映射（`/servlet/*`），或禁用 default servlet 的目录列表功能，并限制对 `WEB-INF` 目录的访问。Red Hat 用户可参考 RHSA-2003:075 和 RHSA-2003:082 获取对应发行版的补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://issues.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=13365","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103470282514938&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=tomcat-dev&m=103417249325526&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-225","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-075.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-082.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6562","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10376","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/29dc6c2b625789e70a9c4756b5a327e6547273ff8bde7e0327af48c5%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/c62b0e3a7bf23342352a5810c640a94b6db69957c5c19db507004d74%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rb71997f506c6cc8b530dd845c084995a9878098846c7b4eacfae8db3%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1394.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1394.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2002/CVE-2002-1394.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/GHSA/data/2002/CVE-2002-1394.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-200