lob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0091","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1403","title":"dhcpcd DHCP 客户端守护进程本地代码执行漏洞","description":"dhcpcd DHCP 客户端守护进程 1.3.22 及更早版本中存在 shell 元字符注入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 dhcpd 的 .info 脚本中注入特制的 shell 元字符，这些字符随后被传递至 .exe 脚本执行，从而以 dhcpcd 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 dhcpcd 1.3.22 及之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1403"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:15Z","remediation":"升级 dhcpcd 至 1.3.17pl2-8.1 或更高版本（Debian 已发布 DSA-219 安全更新），可从 security.debian.org 获取更新包。如无法升级，建议移除 dhcpcd 的 setuid 权限或限制本地用户对 dhcpcd 脚本目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000549","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104189546709447&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-219","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:003","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6200","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10663","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1403.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1403","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1403.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1403.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cjv5-r44f-hxgj/GHSA-cjv5-r44f-hxgj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-219.nasl","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2002/dsa-219.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_146700_146800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1403.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8c236951-a606-419a-a96a-13aa0413fd6c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0090","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1395","title":"Debian Internet Message 不安全临时文件创建漏洞","description":"Debian Internet Message（IM）141-18及更早版本存在以不安全方式创建临时文件的漏洞。该软件使用可预测的文件和目录名称，本地攻击者可利用 impwagent 组件创建的临时目录获取未授权的目录权限，或通过 immknmz 组件覆盖和创建任意文件，导致权限提升或系统文件被篡改。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1395"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"升级 im 软件包至修复版本：Debian Woody 升级到 141-18.1，Debian Sid 升级到 1:141-20。该漏洞源于 impwagent 和 immknmz 使用可预测的临时文件名，本地用户可利用此漏洞越权访问目录或覆盖任意文件。如无法立即升级，可通过设置严格的临时目录权限（如 chmod 0700 /tmp）并限制本地非授权用户登录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/8166","http://secunia.com/advisories/8242","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-202","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10766.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10767.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-039.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6307","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1395","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2002/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/84bee56eebc672b008a8b9d6058ddea66387743b/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1395.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1395.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1395.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0090.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0089","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0089.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1392","title":"mgetty faxspool 传真缓冲目录全局可写权限漏洞","description":"mgetty 1.1.29 之前版本中的 faxspool 组件将传出传真使用的缓冲目录权限设置为全局可写，本地攻击者可利用该目录篡改其他用户的传真传输任务，导致传真内容被拦截、伪造或拒绝服务。攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低。该漏洞影响 mgetty 全系列低于 1.1.29 的版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1392"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"升级 mgetty 至 1.1.29 或更高版本，该版本将传出传真假脱机目录权限修正为仅允许授权用户写入。如无法立即升级，可手动执行 `chmod 755 /var/spool/fax` 限制目录权限，并确保 faxspool 以非 root 的专用系统用户运行，降低本地提权风险。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2003-008 或 RHSA-2003-036 提供的更新包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105154413326136&w=2","http://search.alphanet.ch/cgi-bin/search.cgi?msgid=20021125142338.E12094%40gre