危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1391"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:14Z","remediation":"立即将 mgetty 升级至 1.1.29 或更高版本。Debian 系系统升级至 1.1.30-1 以上版本，Red Hat 系系统安装 RHSA-2003-008 或 RHSA-2003-036 提供的更新包。如无法升级，可在调制解调器配置中禁用 Caller ID 功能或限制 cnd-program 的输入长度作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105154413326136&w=2","http://search.alphanet.ch/cgi-bin/search.cgi?msgid=20021125142338.E12094%40greenie.muc.de&max_results=1&type=long&domain=ml-mgetty","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-008.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-036.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7303","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1391","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bc6988a2a044e68837754c12506c5490595b4bd3/2002/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1391.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1391.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xx